   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "(b)  dist(X,Y) < dist(X,E) + dist(E,Y)      (∞ if E has the overload bit)",
   "originalText": "(b)  dist(X,Y) < dist(X,E) + dist(E,Y)      (∞ if E has the overload bit)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a06-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 317,
   "width": 807,
   "height": 180,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "From  Try  (a) dist = path cost?  (b) avoids router E?   Segment\n----  ---  ---------------------  ---------------------  -------------------------\nS     D    4 ≠ 11  ✗\nS     C    6 ≠ 8   ✗\nS     B    3 ≠ 5   ✗\nS     N    2 = 2   ✓              2 < 2 + 4 = 6  ✓       PrefixSID(N), dropped (B16)\nN     D    6 ≠ 9   ✗\nN     C    6 = 6   ✓              6 < 4 + 4 = 8  ✓       PrefixSID(C)\nC     D    3 = 3   ✓              3 < 4 + 2 = 6  ✓       PrefixSID(D)",
   "originalText": "From  Try  (a) dist = path cost?  (b) avoids router E?   Segment\n----  ---  ---------------------  ---------------------  -------------------------\nS     D    4 ≠ 11  ✗\nS     C    6 ≠ 8   ✗\nS     B    3 ≠ 5   ✗\nS     N    2 = 2   ✓              2 < 2 + 4 = 6  ✓       PrefixSID(N), dropped (B16)\nN     D    6 ≠ 9   ✗\nN     C    6 = 6   ✓              6 < 4 + 4 = 8  ✓       PrefixSID(C)\nC     D    3 = 3   ✓              3 < 4 + 2 = 6  ✓       PrefixSID(D)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
